"<div class=\"brand-bar\"><img src=\"%%A0%%\" alt=\"Sophia Deutsch Akademie\" class=\"brand-logo\"><div class=\"brand-name\">Sophia Deutsch Akademie</div></div><header class=\"lk-hd\"><div class=\"lk-topic\"><svg class=\"ic\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M4 6h16M4 11h10M4 16h5\"></path><path d=\"M13 16h7M17 13l3 3-3 3\"></path></svg></div><div class=\"lk-kicker\">Lektion</div><div class=\"lk-big\">38</div><h1>명사체 1 — 부사절을 전치사구로</h1><div class=\"lk-de\">Nominalisierung I: Vom Nebensatz zur Präpositionalgruppe</div><div class=\"lk-intro\">37과에서 weil → wegen처럼 접속사 문장을 전치사구로 줄이는 법을 처음 배웠어요.<br>C1의 글(신문, 논문, 공문)은 종속절 대신 '전치사 + 명사'를 훨씬 많이 써요. 이런 문체를 명사체(Nominalstil)라고 해요.<br>읽을 때는 이 표현을 문장으로 풀 줄 알아야 하고, 쓸 때는 필요한 곳에서 줄일 줄 알아야 해요.<br>이 과에서는 이유·시간·조건 같은 부사절을 뜻별로 정리하고, 바꾸는 순서를 익혀요.<div class=\"x-goals\"><div class=\"x-goals-t\">이 과에서 익힐 것</div><div class=\"x-goal\">이유 · 양보 · 조건 · 시간 · 목적 · 방법의 종속절을 전치사구로 바꿔요</div><div class=\"x-goal\">동사는 명사로, 주어는 2격으로, 부사는 형용사로 옮겨요</div><div class=\"x-goal\">이유를 나타내는 aus · vor · wegen · dank를 구별해요</div><div class=\"x-goal\">전치사구를 종속절로 풀어 읽어요</div><div class=\"x-goal\">글과 말에 맞는 쪽을 골라 써요</div></div></div></header><div class=\"sub-head\"><span class=\"sub-badge review-badge\">복습</span><span class=\"sub-title\">16·27·35·37과 복습</span></div><div class=\"quiz-block\"><div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">1.</strong> ____ der Kälte gingen wir spazieren. <span class=\"qh\">추운데도</span></div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) Wegen</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) Während</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">c) Trotz</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) Statt</button></div><div class=\"qe\">양보 → trotz + 2격 (16과).</div></div><div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">2.</strong> ankommen → die ____ <span class=\"qh\">명사로</span></div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">a) Ankunft</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) Ankommheit</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) Ankommung</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) Ankünftung</button></div><div class=\"qe\">모양이 많이 바뀌는 명사예요 (35과).</div></div><div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">3.</strong> Nach ____ Ankunft rief er mich an. <span class=\"qh\">그가 도착한 뒤</span></div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) seine</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) seines</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) seinem</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">d) seiner</button></div><div class=\"qe\">nach + 3격, die Ankunft → seiner.</div></div><div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">4.</strong> ____ er studierte, arbeitete er als Kellner. <span class=\"qh\">대학에 다니는 동안</span></div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) Bevor</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">b) Während</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) Nachdem</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) Sobald</button></div><div class=\"qe\">같은 때에 일어난 일 → während (27과).</div></div></div><section id=\"sec-A\"><div class=\"sh\"><span class=\"sl\">A</span><h2>한국어로 먼저 보기</h2></div><p>한국어도 말할 때는 '비가 많이 와서 경기가 취소됐어요'라고 하고, 공지문에는 '우천으로 인한 경기 취소'라고 써요.<br>독일어도 같아요. 말할 때는 <span class=\"gt\" tabindex=\"0\">종속절<span class=\"gt-tip\"><span class=\"gt-t\">종속절</span>주문장에 딸린 문장이에요. 활용된 동사가 맨 끝에 오고, 쉼표로 주문장과 나눠요.<span class=\"gt-ex\">예: …, weil ich krank bin.</span></span></span>로 풀어 말하고, 글에서는 <span class=\"gt\" tabindex=\"0\">전치사<span class=\"gt-tip\"><span class=\"gt-t\">전치사</span>명사·대명사 앞에 붙어 장소·시간·이유 같은 관계를 나타내는 말이에요. 뒤에 올 격을 정해요.<span class=\"gt-ex\">예: mit dem Bus · für dich</span></span></span>와 <span class=\"gt\" tabindex=\"0\">명사<span class=\"gt-tip\"><span class=\"gt-t\">명사</span>사람·동물·물건·장소·생각의 이름이 되는 말이에요. 독일어 명사는 첫 글자를 대문자로 써요.<span class=\"gt-ex\">예: der Tisch 책상 · die Liebe 사랑</span></span></span>로 줄여 써요.<br>문장을 명사 덩어리로 줄이는 것을 <span class=\"gt\" tabindex=\"0\">명사화<span class=\"gt-tip\"><span class=\"gt-t\">명사화</span>동사나 형용사를 명사로 바꿔, 문장 하나를 명사 덩어리로 줄이는 방법이에요(Nominalisierung).<span class=\"gt-ex\">예: weil es regnet → wegen des Regens</span></span></span>, 다시 문장으로 푸는 것을 <span class=\"gt\" tabindex=\"0\">동사화<span class=\"gt-tip\"><span class=\"gt-t\">동사화</span>명사로 줄인 표현을 동사가 있는 문장으로 다시 푸는 방법이에요(Verbalisierung).<span class=\"gt-ex\">예: nach seiner Ankunft → nachdem er angekommen war</span></span></span>라고 해요.</p><div class=\"dgm\"><div class=\"dgm-cap\">같은 내용, 두 가지 문체</div><div class=\"tbl-wrap\"><table class=\"t-left t-first\"><thead><tr><th></th><th>풀어 쓴 문장 · Verbalstil</th><th>명사로 줄인 표현 · Nominalstil</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>이유</td><td><strong>Weil</strong> die Preise deutlich <strong>gestiegen sind</strong>, kaufen die Leute weniger.</td><td><strong>Wegen des</strong> deutlichen <strong>Anstiegs</strong> der Preise kaufen die Leute weniger.</td></tr><tr><td>시간</td><td><strong>Nachdem</strong> das Flugzeug <strong>gelandet war</strong>, stiegen alle aus.</td><td><strong>Nach der Landung</strong> des Flugzeugs stiegen alle aus.</td></tr><tr><td>쓰는 곳</td><td>대화, 메일, 설명</td><td>신문, 논문, 공문, 안내문</td></tr></tbody></table></div><div class=\"dgm-note\">뜻은 같아요. 명사로 줄인 쪽이 짧고 딱딱해요. C1 독해에서는 이 표현을 문장으로 풀 줄 알아야 해요.</div></div></section><section id=\"sec-B\"><div class=\"sh\"><span class=\"sl\">B</span><h2>뜻별 대응표 — 접속사와 전치사의 짝</h2></div><div class=\"callout callout-easy\"><span class=\"co-badge co-easy\">쉽게 말하면</span><div><p style=\"margin:0 0 8px\">접속사마다 짝이 되는 전치사가 있어요 — weil ↔ wegen, obwohl ↔ trotz, wenn ↔ bei, nachdem ↔ nach.</p></div></div><div class=\"tbl-wrap\"><table class=\"t-left t-first\"><thead><tr><th>뜻</th><th>접속사 + 문장</th><th>전치사 + 명사</th><th>예</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>이유</td><td>weil · da</td><td>wegen · aufgrund + 2격</td><td><strong>Wegen</strong> des Streiks fällt der Zug aus.</td></tr><tr><td>양보</td><td>obwohl</td><td>trotz + 2격</td><td><strong>Trotz</strong> des Regens gehen wir spazieren.</td></tr><tr><td>조건</td><td>wenn · falls</td><td>bei + 3격 · im Falle + 2격</td><td><strong>Bei</strong> Regen bleiben wir zu Hause.</td></tr><tr><td>~⁠할 때</td><td>als · wenn</td><td>bei + 3격</td><td><strong>Bei</strong> meiner Ankunft schliefen alle.</td></tr><tr><td>~⁠하는 동안</td><td>während</td><td>während + 2격</td><td><strong>Während</strong> des Essens sprach niemand.</td></tr><tr><td>~⁠하기 전에</td><td>bevor</td><td>vor + 3격</td><td><strong>Vor</strong> dem Essen wasche ich mir die Hände.</td></tr><tr><td>~⁠한 뒤에</td><td>nachdem</td><td>nach + 3격</td><td><strong>Nach</strong> dem Essen gehe ich spazieren.</td></tr><tr><td>~⁠한 뒤로</td><td>seit · seitdem</td><td>seit + 3격</td><td><strong>Seit</strong> dem Umzug sehe ich ihn selten.</td></tr><tr><td>~⁠할 때까지</td><td>bis</td><td>bis zu + 3격</td><td><strong>Bis zur</strong> Abfahrt haben wir noch Zeit.</td></tr><tr><td>목적</td><td>um … zu · damit</td><td>zu + 3격 · zwecks + 2격</td><td><strong>Zur</strong> Vorbereitung lese ich das Buch.</td></tr><tr><td>방법</td><td>indem · dadurch, dass</td><td>durch + 4격 · mit + 3격</td><td><strong>Durch</strong> tägliches Üben wird man besser.</td></tr><tr><td>대조</td><td>während · wohingegen</td><td>im Gegensatz zu + 3격</td><td><strong>Im Gegensatz zu</strong> mir steht sie früh auf.</td></tr><tr><td>대신 · 없이</td><td>statt … zu · ohne … zu</td><td>statt + 2격 · ohne + 4격</td><td><strong>Ohne</strong> Visum darf man nicht einreisen.</td></tr></tbody></table></div><figure class=\"photo\"><img src=\"data:image/webp;base64,\" alt=\"Bei Regen bleiben wir zu Hause. 비가 오면 우리는 집에 있어요. wenn es regnet → bei Regen\" width=\"1280\" height=\"720\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\"><figcaption><div><span class=\"ph-de\"><strong>Bei Regen</strong> bleiben wir zu Hause.</span><span class=\"ph-ko\">비가 오면 우리는 집에 있어요. wenn es regnet → bei Regen</span></div></figcaption></figure><div class=\"callout callout-note\"><span class=\"co-badge co-note\">37과와 함께</span><div><p style=\"margin:0 0 8px\">37과에서 weil → wegen, obwohl → trotz, wenn → bei, nachdem → nach를 배웠어요. 이 과에서는 모든 부사절로 넓히고, 주어와 부사를 옮기는 규칙을 익혀요.</p></div></div><div class=\"sub-head\"><span class=\"sub-badge\">바로 확인</span><span class=\"sub-title\">접속사와 전치사의 짝</span></div><div class=\"quiz-block\"><div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">1.</strong> ____ des schlechten Wetters fand das Konzert statt. <span class=\"qh\">날씨가 나빴는데도</span></div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) Wegen</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">b) Trotz</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) Durch</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) Bei</button></div><div class=\"qe\">양보 obwohl ↔ trotz.</div></div><div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">2.</strong> ____ Feuer bitte den Aufzug nicht benutzen. <span class=\"qh\">불이 나면</span></div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) Trotz</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) Seit</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) Nach</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">d) Bei</button></div><div class=\"qe\">조건 wenn ↔ bei.</div></div><div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">3.</strong> ____ seiner Rückkehr hat er nicht mehr angerufen. <span class=\"qh\">돌아온 뒤로</span></div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) Vor</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) Bis zu</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">c) Seit</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) Bei</button></div><div class=\"qe\">seitdem ↔ seit.</div></div><div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">4.</strong> ____ regelmäßiges Training wurde sie schneller. <span class=\"qh\">꾸준히 훈련해서</span></div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) Trotz</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">b) Durch</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) Vor</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) Bis zu</button></div><div class=\"qe\">방법 indem ↔ durch.</div></div></div></section><section id=\"sec-C\"><div class=\"sh\"><span class=\"sl\">C</span><h2>바꾸는 순서 — 네 가지가 바뀌어요</h2></div><div class=\"callout callout-easy\"><span class=\"co-badge co-easy\">쉽게 말하면</span><div><p style=\"margin:0 0 8px\">네 가지만 바꾸면 돼요 — 접속사는 전치사로, 동사는 명사로, 주어는 2격으로, 부사는 형용사로.</p></div></div><figure class=\"fig\"><div class=\"fig-scroll\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 600 270\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"종속절을 전치사구로 바꾸는 순서 — 접속사는 전치사로, 동사는 명사로, 주어는 2격으로, 부사는 형용사로 바뀌어요\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><defs><marker id=\"l38-order-ink\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"8.6\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"7\" markerHeight=\"7\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"><path d=\"M0,0 L10,5 L0,10 z\" class=\"f-mki\"/></marker><marker id=\"l38-order-acc\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"8.6\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"7\" markerHeight=\"7\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"><path d=\"M0,0 L10,5 L0,10 z\" class=\"f-mka\"/></marker><marker id=\"l38-order-ok\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"8.6\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"7\" markerHeight=\"7\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"><path d=\"M0,0 L10,5 L0,10 z\" class=\"f-mko\"/></marker><marker id=\"l38-order-no\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"8.6\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"7\" markerHeight=\"7\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"><path d=\"M0,0 L10,5 L0,10 z\" class=\"f-mkn\"/></marker><marker id=\"l38-order-w\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"8.6\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"7\" markerHeight=\"7\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"><path d=\"M0,0 L10,5 L0,10 z\" class=\"f-mkw\"/></marker></defs><rect x=\"110.1\" y=\"29.0\" width=\"64.8\" height=\"42.0\" rx=\"8\" class=\"f-boxo\"/><text x=\"142.6\" y=\"56.8\" font-size=\"19\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"f-okt\" font-weight=\"700\">Weil</text><rect x=\"183.0\" y=\"29.0\" width=\"118.6\" height=\"42.0\" rx=\"8\" class=\"f-boxa\"/><text x=\"242.3\" y=\"56.8\" font-size=\"19\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"f-a\" font-weight=\"700\">die Preise</text><rect x=\"309.6\" y=\"29.0\" width=\"72.6\" height=\"42.0\" rx=\"8\" class=\"f-box\"/><text x=\"345.9\" y=\"56.8\" font-size=\"19\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"f-t\" font-weight=\"700\">stark</text><rect x=\"390.2\" y=\"29.0\" width=\"99.6\" height=\"42.0\" rx=\"8\" class=\"f-boxw\"/><text x=\"440.1\" y=\"56.8\" font-size=\"19\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"f-wt\" font-weight=\"700\">steigen,</text><rect x=\"49.7\" y=\"151.0\" width=\"87.7\" height=\"42.0\" rx=\"8\" class=\"f-boxo\"/><text x=\"93.5\" y=\"178.8\" font-size=\"19\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"f-okt\" font-weight=\"700\">Wegen</text><rect x=\"145.3\" y=\"151.0\" width=\"58.2\" height=\"42.0\" rx=\"8\" class=\"f-box\"/><text x=\"174.4\" y=\"178.8\" font-size=\"19\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"f-t\" font-weight=\"700\">des</text><rect x=\"211.5\" y=\"151.0\" width=\"95.4\" height=\"42.0\" rx=\"8\" class=\"f-box\"/><text x=\"259.2\" y=\"178.8\" font-size=\"19\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"f-t\" font-weight=\"700\">starken</text><rect x=\"315.0\" y=\"151.0\" width=\"107.2\" height=\"42.0\" rx=\"8\" class=\"f-boxw\"/><text x=\"368.6\" y=\"178.8\" font-size=\"19\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"f-wt\" font-weight=\"700\">Anstiegs</text><rect x=\"430.2\" y=\"151.0\" width=\"120.1\" height=\"42.0\" rx=\"8\" class=\"f-boxa\"/><text x=\"490.3\" y=\"178.8\" font-size=\"19\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"f-a\" font-weight=\"700\">der Preise</text><line x1=\"142.6\" y1=\"72.0\" x2=\"93.5\" y2=\"148.0\" class=\"f-lo\" marker-end=\"url(#l38-order-ok)\"/><text x=\"131.0\" y=\"116.0\" font-size=\"16\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"f-okt\" font-weight=\"700\">①</text><line x1=\"440.1\" y1=\"72.0\" x2=\"368.6\" y2=\"148.0\" class=\"f-lw\" marker-end=\"url(#l38-order-w)\"/><text x=\"417.3\" y=\"116.0\" font-size=\"16\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"f-wt\" font-weight=\"700\">②</text><line x1=\"242.3\" y1=\"72.0\" x2=\"490.3\" y2=\"148.0\" class=\"f-la\" marker-end=\"url(#l38-order-acc)\"/><text x=\"379.3\" y=\"116.0\" font-size=\"16\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"f-a\" font-weight=\"700\">③</text><line x1=\"345.9\" y1=\"72.0\" x2=\"259.2\" y2=\"148.0\" class=\"f-ln\" marker-end=\"url(#l38-order-ink)\"/><text x=\"315.6\" y=\"116.0\" font-size=\"16\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"f-t\" font-weight=\"700\">④</text><text x=\"300.0\" y=\"228.0\" font-size=\"15\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"f-t\"><tspan font-weight=\"700\" class=\"f-okt\">①</tspan> 접속사 → 전치사 · <tspan font-weight=\"700\" class=\"f-wt\">②</tspan> 동사 → 명사 · <tspan font-weight=\"700\" class=\"f-a\">③</tspan> 주어 → 2격 · <tspan font-weight=\"700\" class=\"f-t\">④</tspan> 부사 → 형용사</text><text x=\"300.0\" y=\"254.0\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"f-m\">wegen 뒤의 des … Anstiegs도 2격이에요</text></svg></div><figcaption>주어였던 die Preise는 명사 뒤로 가서 2격이 돼요</figcaption></figure><div class=\"dgm-seq\"><div class=\"dgm-step\"><div class=\"dgm-num\">1</div><div class=\"dgm-step-b\"><div class=\"dgm-step-t\">접속사 → 전치사</div><div>weil → wegen · obwohl → trotz · wenn → bei</div></div></div><div class=\"dgm-step\"><div class=\"dgm-num\">2</div><div class=\"dgm-step-b\"><div class=\"dgm-step-t\">동사 · 형용사 → 명사 (35과)</div><div>steigen → der Anstieg · ankommen → die Ankunft · krank → die Krankheit</div></div></div><div class=\"dgm-step\"><div class=\"dgm-num\">3</div><div class=\"dgm-step-b\"><div class=\"dgm-step-t\">주어 → 명사 뒤의 2격, 대명사 주어 → 소유관사</div><div>die Preise steigen → der Anstieg <strong>der Preise</strong> · er kommt an → <strong>seine</strong> Ankunft</div></div></div><div class=\"dgm-step\"><div class=\"dgm-num\">4</div><div class=\"dgm-step-b\"><div class=\"dgm-step-t\">부사 → 형용사 + 어미 (23·24과)</div><div>stark steigen → der stark<span class=\"x-e\">e</span> Anstieg · plötzlich ankommen → die plötzlich<span class=\"x-e\">e</span> Ankunft</div></div></div></div><h3>자주 바꾸는 동사와 명사</h3><div class=\"tbl-wrap\"><table class=\"t-left\"><thead><tr><th>동사 · 형용사</th><th>명사</th><th>동사 · 형용사</th><th>명사</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>steigen 오르다</td><td>der Anstieg</td><td>sinken · zurückgehen 줄다</td><td>der Rückgang</td></tr><tr><td>zunehmen 늘다</td><td>die Zunahme</td><td>abnehmen 줄다</td><td>die Abnahme</td></tr><tr><td>ankommen 도착하다</td><td>die Ankunft</td><td>abfahren 출발하다</td><td>die Abfahrt</td></tr><tr><td>beginnen 시작하다</td><td>der Beginn</td><td>enden 끝나다</td><td>das Ende</td></tr><tr><td>sich entwickeln 발전하다</td><td>die Entwicklung</td><td>sich verbessern 나아지다</td><td>die Verbesserung</td></tr><tr><td>umziehen 이사하다</td><td>der Umzug</td><td>zurückkehren 돌아오다</td><td>die Rückkehr</td></tr><tr><td>helfen 돕다</td><td>die Hilfe</td><td>fehlen 없다</td><td>das Fehlen · der Mangel</td></tr><tr><td>krank sein 아프다</td><td>die Krankheit</td><td>abwesend sein 자리에 없다</td><td>die Abwesenheit</td></tr></tbody></table></div><div class=\"callout callout-note\"><span class=\"co-badge co-note\">관사 없이 쓰는 짧은 꼴</span><div><p style=\"margin:0 0 8px\">안내문과 제목에서는 관사를 자주 빼요 — <strong>bei</strong> Regen · <strong>nach</strong> Ankunft · <strong>vor</strong> Beginn des Kurses · <strong>bei</strong> Bedarf.<br>관사 없이 형용사가 붙으면 형용사가 강변화 어미를 받아요 — bei stark<span class=\"x-e\">em</span> Regen · trotz groß<span class=\"x-e\">er</span> Mühe (24과).</p></div></div><div class=\"sub-head\"><span class=\"sub-badge\">바로 확인</span><span class=\"sub-title\">바꾸는 순서</span></div><div class=\"quiz-block\"><div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">1.</strong> Weil der Verkehr zunimmt, … → Wegen ____ des Verkehrs …</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">a) der Zunahme</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) die Zunahme</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) dem Zunehmen</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) des Zunahmes</button></div><div class=\"qe\">wegen + 2격, die Zunahme → der Zunahme.</div></div><div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">2.</strong> Als er ankam, … → Bei ____ Ankunft …</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">a) seiner</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) seine</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) ihm</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) er</button></div><div class=\"qe\">대명사 주어 → 소유관사, bei + 3격.</div></div><div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">3.</strong> Obwohl es heftig regnete, … → Trotz des ____ Regens …</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) heftige</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) heftiger</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) heftig</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">d) heftigen</button></div><div class=\"qe\">부사 → 형용사, 2격 남성 -en.</div></div><div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">4.</strong> Bevor der Unterricht beginnt, … → Vor ____ des Unterrichts …</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) Begonnen</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) Beginnung</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) Beginnt</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">d) Beginn</button></div><div class=\"qe\">beginnen → der Beginn.</div></div></div></section><section id=\"sec-D\"><div class=\"sh\"><span class=\"sl\">D</span><h2>시간 — bei · während · vor · nach · seit · bis zu</h2></div><div class=\"callout callout-easy\"><span class=\"co-badge co-easy\">쉽게 말하면</span><div><p style=\"margin:0 0 8px\">'~⁠할 때'는 bei, '~⁠하는 동안'은 während, 앞뒤는 vor · nach예요.</p></div></div><div class=\"exl\"><div class=\"exl-i\"><span class=\"exl-de\"><strong>Als</strong> ich das Haus <strong>verließ</strong>, begann es zu regnen.<br>→ <strong>Beim Verlassen</strong> des Hauses begann es zu regnen.</span><span class=\"exl-ko\">집을 나설 때 비가 오기 시작했어요.</span></div><div class=\"exl-i\"><span class=\"exl-de\"><strong>Wenn</strong> man Auto <strong>fährt</strong>, darf man nicht telefonieren.<br>→ <strong>Beim Autofahren</strong> darf man nicht telefonieren.</span><span class=\"exl-ko\">운전할 때는 통화하면 안 돼요.</span></div><div class=\"exl-i\"><span class=\"exl-de\"><strong>Bevor</strong> der Kurs <strong>beginnt</strong>, muss man sich anmelden.<br>→ <strong>Vor Beginn</strong> des Kurses muss man sich anmelden.</span><span class=\"exl-ko\">강좌가 시작되기 전에 등록해야 해요.</span></div><div class=\"exl-i\"><span class=\"exl-de\"><strong>Nachdem</strong> er die Lehre <strong>abgeschlossen hatte</strong>, ging er ins Ausland.<br>→ <strong>Nach dem Abschluss</strong> der Lehre ging er ins Ausland.</span><span class=\"exl-ko\">직업 교육을 마친 뒤 외국으로 갔어요.</span></div><div class=\"exl-i\"><span class=\"exl-de\"><strong>Seit</strong> er <strong>umgezogen ist</strong>, sehen wir uns selten.<br>→ <strong>Seit seinem Umzug</strong> sehen wir uns selten.</span><span class=\"exl-ko\">그가 이사한 뒤로 자주 못 봐요.</span></div><div class=\"exl-i\"><span class=\"exl-de\"><strong>Bis</strong> der Zug <strong>abfährt</strong>, trinken wir einen Kaffee.<br>→ <strong>Bis zur Abfahrt</strong> des Zuges trinken wir einen Kaffee.</span><span class=\"exl-ko\">기차가 떠날 때까지 커피를 마셔요.</span></div></div><div class=\"callout callout-key\"><span class=\"co-badge \">beim + 대문자로 쓴 원형</span><div><p style=\"margin:0 0 8px\">'~⁠할 때 · ~⁠하는 중에'는 beim + 원형 명사(35과)로 가장 쉽게 줄여요 — beim Essen · beim Lesen · beim Einkaufen.<br>목적어는 앞에 붙여 한 단어로 쓰거나 뒤에 2격으로 써요 — beim <strong>Auto</strong>fahren · beim Verlassen <strong>des Hauses</strong>.</p></div></div><div class=\"callout callout-note\"><span class=\"co-badge co-note\">sobald는 gleich nach</span><div><p style=\"margin:0 0 8px\">'~⁠하자마자'는 gleich nach · unmittelbar nach + 3격이에요.<br><strong>Sobald</strong> er angekommen war, rief er an. → <strong>Gleich nach</strong> seiner Ankunft rief er an.</p></div></div><div class=\"sub-head\"><span class=\"sub-badge\">바로 확인</span><span class=\"sub-title\">시간</span></div><div class=\"quiz-block\"><div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">1.</strong> Während sie in Berlin studierte, … → Während ____ in Berlin …</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) ihr Studium</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) ihrer Studium</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) ihrem Studium</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">d) ihres Studiums</button></div><div class=\"qe\">während + 2격, das Studium → ihres Studiums.</div></div><div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">2.</strong> ____ Essen sollte man nicht aufs Handy schauen. <span class=\"qh\">밥 먹을 때</span></div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) Zum</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) Am</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) Bei</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">d) Beim</button></div><div class=\"qe\">beim + 원형 명사.</div></div><div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">3.</strong> Nachdem der Film geendet hatte, … → Nach ____ des Films …</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) des Endes</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">b) dem Ende</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) das Ende</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) der Ende</button></div><div class=\"qe\">nach + 3격, das Ende → dem Ende.</div></div><div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">4.</strong> Bis die Ferien beginnen, … → Bis ____ Beginn der Ferien …</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) zu</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) zur</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) am</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">d) zum</button></div><div class=\"qe\">bis zu + 3격, der Beginn → zum Beginn.</div></div></div></section><section id=\"sec-E\"><div class=\"sh\"><span class=\"sl\">E</span><h2>이유 · 양보 · 조건 — 전치사 고르기</h2></div><div class=\"callout callout-easy\"><span class=\"co-badge co-easy\">쉽게 말하면</span><div><p style=\"margin:0 0 8px\">이유는 wegen · aufgrund이 기본이에요. 마음에서 나온 이유는 aus, 몸이 저절로 반응한 이유는 vor를 써요.</p></div></div><div class=\"tbl-wrap\"><table class=\"t-left t-first\"><thead><tr><th>전치사</th><th>쓰임</th><th>예</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>wegen · aufgrund</strong> + 2격</td><td>일반적인 이유</td><td><strong>Aufgrund</strong> einer Störung verspätet sich der Flug.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>aus</strong> + 3격 (관사 없이)</td><td>스스로 한 행동의 동기</td><td><strong>Aus</strong> Angst sagte er nichts. · aus Liebe · aus Neugier · aus Zeitmangel</td></tr><tr><td><strong>vor</strong> + 3격 (관사 없이)</td><td>저절로 나오는 몸의 반응</td><td>Sie weinte <strong>vor</strong> Freude. · vor Kälte zittern · vor Schmerzen schreien</td></tr><tr><td><strong>dank</strong> + 2격</td><td>좋은 결과를 낳은 이유</td><td><strong>Dank</strong> ihrer Hilfe wurde ich rechtzeitig fertig.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>trotz</strong> + 2격</td><td>양보 — ~⁠인데도</td><td><strong>Trotz</strong> seiner Erkältung ging er zur Arbeit.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>bei</strong> + 3격</td><td>조건 — ~⁠하면</td><td><strong>Bei</strong> starkem Wind bleibt die Seilbahn geschlossen.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>im Falle</strong> + 2격</td><td>조건 — ~⁠할 경우 (공문)</td><td><strong>Im Falle</strong> einer Absage bekommen Sie Ihr Geld zurück.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>ohne</strong> + 4격</td><td>조건 — ~⁠하지 않으면</td><td><strong>Ohne</strong> Anmeldung kann man nicht teilnehmen.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>mit</strong> + 3격</td><td>조건 — ~⁠이 있으면</td><td><strong>Mit</strong> etwas Glück erreichen wir den Zug noch.</td></tr></tbody></table></div><div class=\"exl\"><div class=\"exl-i\"><span class=\"exl-de\"><strong>Weil</strong> er neugierig <strong>war</strong>, öffnete er den Brief.<br>→ <strong>Aus Neugier</strong> öffnete er den Brief.</span><span class=\"exl-ko\">궁금해서 편지를 열었어요.</span></div><div class=\"exl-i\"><span class=\"exl-de\"><strong>Weil</strong> sie so <strong>fror</strong>, zitterte sie.<br>→ Sie zitterte <strong>vor Kälte</strong>.</span><span class=\"exl-ko\">추워서 떨었어요.</span></div><div class=\"exl-i\"><span class=\"exl-de\"><strong>Obwohl</strong> sie sich sehr <strong>bemühte</strong>, bestand sie die Prüfung nicht.<br>→ <strong>Trotz großer Bemühungen</strong> bestand sie die Prüfung nicht.</span><span class=\"exl-ko\">많이 노력했는데도 시험에 떨어졌어요.</span></div><div class=\"exl-i\"><span class=\"exl-de\"><strong>Wenn</strong> man keine Brille <strong>trägt</strong>, sieht man hier nichts.<br>→ <strong>Ohne Brille</strong> sieht man hier nichts.</span><span class=\"exl-ko\">안경이 없으면 여기서는 아무것도 안 보여요.</span></div></div><div class=\"callout callout-warn\"><span class=\"co-badge co-warn\">nicht · kein이 있는 문장</span><div><p style=\"margin:0 0 8px\">부정은 전치사나 명사에 넣어요.<br>wenn man sich <strong>nicht</strong> anmeldet → <strong>ohne</strong> Anmeldung · weil Geld <strong>fehlt</strong> → <strong>aus</strong> Geld<strong>mangel</strong> · weil er <strong>nicht</strong> da war → wegen seiner <strong>Ab</strong>wesenheit.</p></div></div><div class=\"sub-head\"><span class=\"sub-badge\">바로 확인</span><span class=\"sub-title\">이유 · 양보 · 조건</span></div><div class=\"quiz-block\"><div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">1.</strong> Er half ihr ____ Mitleid. <span class=\"qh\">불쌍한 마음에서</span></div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">a) aus</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) vor</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) bei</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) durch</button></div><div class=\"qe\">스스로 한 행동의 동기 → aus.</div></div><div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">2.</strong> Das Kind schrie ____ Schmerzen. <span class=\"qh\">아파서</span></div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) mit</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">b) vor</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) bei</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) aus</button></div><div class=\"qe\">저절로 나오는 반응 → vor.</div></div><div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">3.</strong> Wenn man keinen Führerschein hat, darf man nicht fahren. → ____ Führerschein darf man nicht fahren.</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) Bei</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) Aus</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">c) Ohne</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) Trotz</button></div><div class=\"qe\">wenn … kein → ohne.</div></div><div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">4.</strong> Obwohl er krank war, kam er. → ____ seiner Krankheit kam er.</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) Aus</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) Wegen</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) Dank</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">d) Trotz</button></div><div class=\"qe\">obwohl → trotz.</div></div><div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">5.</strong> ____ deiner Unterstützung habe ich das Stipendium bekommen. <span class=\"qh\">네가 도와준 덕분에</span></div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) Ohne</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) Vor</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">c) Dank</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) Trotz</button></div><div class=\"qe\">좋은 결과의 이유 → dank.</div></div></div></section><section id=\"sec-F\"><div class=\"sh\"><span class=\"sl\">F</span><h2>목적 · 방법 — zu · durch</h2></div><div class=\"callout callout-easy\"><span class=\"co-badge co-easy\">쉽게 말하면</span><div><p style=\"margin:0 0 8px\">'~⁠하려고'는 zu + 명사, '~⁠함으로써'는 durch + 명사예요.</p></div></div><div class=\"exl\"><div class=\"exl-i\"><span class=\"exl-de\"><strong>Um</strong> die Kosten <strong>zu senken</strong>, schließt die Firma zwei Filialen.<br>→ <strong>Zur Senkung</strong> der Kosten schließt die Firma zwei Filialen.</span><span class=\"exl-ko\">비용을 줄이려고 회사는 지점 두 곳을 닫아요.</span></div><div class=\"exl-i\"><span class=\"exl-de\"><strong>Um</strong> sich auf das Interview <strong>vorzubereiten</strong>, liest er alle Unterlagen.<br>→ <strong>Zur Vorbereitung</strong> auf das Interview liest er alle Unterlagen.</span><span class=\"exl-ko\">면접을 준비하려고 서류를 다 읽어요.</span></div><div class=\"exl-i\"><span class=\"exl-de\"><strong>Indem</strong> man regelmäßig Sport <strong>treibt</strong>, bleibt man gesund.<br>→ <strong>Durch</strong> regelmäßigen <strong>Sport</strong> bleibt man gesund.</span><span class=\"exl-ko\">꾸준히 운동하면 건강을 지켜요.</span></div><div class=\"exl-i\"><span class=\"exl-de\"><strong>Dadurch, dass</strong> die Preise <strong>erhöht wurden</strong>, sank die Nachfrage.<br>→ <strong>Durch die Erhöhung</strong> der Preise sank die Nachfrage.</span><span class=\"exl-ko\">가격을 올려서 수요가 줄었어요.</span></div></div><div class=\"callout callout-note\"><span class=\"co-badge co-note\">4격 목적어도 2격이 돼요</span><div><p style=\"margin:0 0 8px\">동사의 4격 목적어는 명사 뒤에서 2격이 돼요 — <strong>die Kosten</strong> senken → die Senkung <strong>der Kosten</strong>.<br>전치사를 받는 동사는 전치사를 그대로 가져가요 — sich <strong>auf</strong> das Interview vorbereiten → die Vorbereitung <strong>auf</strong> das Interview. 자세한 규칙은 39과에서 배워요.</p></div></div><div class=\"sub-head\"><span class=\"sub-badge\">바로 확인</span><span class=\"sub-title\">목적 · 방법</span></div><div class=\"quiz-block\"><div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">1.</strong> Um die Umwelt zu schonen, fährt er Rad. → ____ der Umwelt fährt er Rad.</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) Trotz Schonung</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) Bei Schonung</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">c) Zur Schonung</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) Durch Schonung</button></div><div class=\"qe\">um … zu → zu + 명사.</div></div><div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">2.</strong> Indem man Fehler analysiert, lernt man. → ____ die Analyse von Fehlern lernt man.</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) Seit</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) Zu</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">c) Durch</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) Trotz</button></div><div class=\"qe\">indem → durch + 4격.</div></div><div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">3.</strong> Zur ____ der Luftqualität wurden Bäume gepflanzt. <span class=\"qh\">공기 질을 좋게 하려고</span></div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) Verbessern</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) Besserheit</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) Verbesserte</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">d) Verbesserung</button></div><div class=\"qe\">verbessern → die Verbesserung.</div></div></div></section><section id=\"sec-G\"><div class=\"sh\"><span class=\"sl\">G</span><h2>전치사구를 문장으로 풀기</h2></div><div class=\"callout callout-easy\"><span class=\"co-badge co-easy\">쉽게 말하면</span><div><p style=\"margin:0 0 8px\">읽을 때는 거꾸로 해요 — 전치사에서 접속사를, 명사에서 동사를 찾아 문장으로 풀어요.</p></div></div><div class=\"dgm-seq\"><div class=\"dgm-step\"><div class=\"dgm-num\">1</div><div class=\"dgm-step-b\"><div class=\"dgm-step-t\">전치사 → 접속사</div><div>trotz → obwohl · bei → wenn, als · nach → nachdem</div></div></div><div class=\"dgm-step\"><div class=\"dgm-num\">2</div><div class=\"dgm-step-b\"><div class=\"dgm-step-t\">명사 → 동사</div><div>die Ankunft → ankommen · der Anstieg → steigen</div></div></div><div class=\"dgm-step\"><div class=\"dgm-num\">3</div><div class=\"dgm-step-b\"><div class=\"dgm-step-t\">2격 · 소유관사 → 주어 (타동사면 목적어)</div><div>die Ankunft <strong>der Gäste</strong> → <strong>die Gäste</strong> kommen an · <strong>seine</strong> Ankunft → <strong>er</strong> kommt an</div></div></div><div class=\"dgm-step\"><div class=\"dgm-num\">4</div><div class=\"dgm-step-b\"><div class=\"dgm-step-t\">형용사 → 부사, 시제는 주문장에 맞춰요</div><div>der <strong>starke</strong> Anstieg → <strong>stark</strong> steigen</div></div></div></div><div class=\"exl\"><div class=\"exl-i\"><span class=\"exl-de\"><strong>Trotz</strong> der hohen Kosten baute die Stadt die Brücke.<br>→ <strong>Obwohl</strong> die Kosten hoch <strong>waren</strong>, baute die Stadt die Brücke.</span><span class=\"exl-ko\">비용이 많이 드는데도 시는 다리를 지었어요.</span></div><div class=\"exl-i\"><span class=\"exl-de\"><strong>Bei</strong> Einbruch der Dunkelheit kehrten wir um.<br>→ <strong>Als</strong> es dunkel <strong>wurde</strong>, kehrten wir um.</span><span class=\"exl-ko\">어두워지자 우리는 돌아섰어요.</span></div><div class=\"exl-i\"><span class=\"exl-de\"><strong>Nach</strong> Beendigung des Kurses fand sie sofort eine Stelle.<br>→ <strong>Nachdem</strong> sie den Kurs <strong>beendet hatte</strong>, fand sie sofort eine Stelle.</span><span class=\"exl-ko\">과정을 마친 뒤 바로 일자리를 구했어요.</span></div></div><div class=\"callout callout-warn\"><span class=\"co-badge co-warn\">nachdem은 한 단계 앞선 시제</span><div><p style=\"margin:0 0 8px\">nach를 nachdem으로 풀 때는 27과의 규칙을 지켜요 — 주문장이 과거면 과거완료, 현재면 현재완료.<br>Nach dem Essen <strong>ging</strong> er. → Nachdem er <strong>gegessen hatte</strong>, ging er.</p></div></div><div class=\"sub-head\"><span class=\"sub-badge\">바로 확인</span><span class=\"sub-title\">문장으로 풀기</span></div><div class=\"quiz-block\"><div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">1.</strong> Trotz seiner Erschöpfung lief er weiter. → ____ er erschöpft war, lief er weiter.</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">a) Obwohl</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) Nachdem</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) Wenn</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) Weil</button></div><div class=\"qe\">trotz → obwohl.</div></div><div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">2.</strong> Nach seiner Ankunft rief er an. → Nachdem er ____, rief er an.</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) ankam</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">b) angekommen war</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) ankommt</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) angekommen ist</button></div><div class=\"qe\">주문장이 과거 → 과거완료.</div></div><div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">3.</strong> Bei Glatteis fahre ich nicht. → ____ es glatt ist, fahre ich nicht.</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) Bevor</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">b) Wenn</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) Obwohl</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) Damit</button></div><div class=\"qe\">조건의 bei → wenn.</div></div><div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">4.</strong> Wegen des Ausfalls der Heizung blieb die Schule geschlossen. → Weil ____, blieb die Schule geschlossen.</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) des Ausfalls war</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) die Heizung ausfallen</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">c) die Heizung ausgefallen war</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) der Heizung ausfiel</button></div><div class=\"qe\">2격 der Heizung → 주어 die Heizung, der Ausfall → ausfallen.</div></div></div></section><section id=\"sec-H\"><div class=\"sh\"><span class=\"sl\">H</span><h2>가장 많이 하는 실수</h2></div><div class=\"trap\"><div class=\"trap-head\"><span class=\"trap-badge\">실수 1</span><span class=\"trap-label\">Fehler</span></div><div style=\"font-weight:600;margin-bottom:10px\">전치사 뒤에 문장을 그대로 둬요</div><div class=\"trap-ex wrong\"><span style=\"color:var(--no);font-weight:700\">✕</span><span class=\"tx-b\">Wegen es regnete, blieben wir zu Hause.<span class=\"tx-n\">전치사 + 문장</span></span></div><div class=\"trap-ex right\"><span style=\"color:var(--ok);font-weight:700\">✓</span><span class=\"tx-b\">Wegen des Regens blieben wir zu Hause.<span class=\"tx-n\">비 때문에 집에 있었어요</span></span></div><div class=\"trap-note\"><span class=\"gt\" tabindex=\"0\">전치사<span class=\"gt-tip\"><span class=\"gt-t\">전치사</span>명사·대명사 앞에 붙어 장소·시간·이유 같은 관계를 나타내는 말이에요. 뒤에 올 격을 정해요.<span class=\"gt-ex\">예: mit dem Bus · für dich</span></span></span> 뒤에는 <span class=\"gt\" tabindex=\"0\">명사<span class=\"gt-tip\"><span class=\"gt-t\">명사</span>사람·동물·물건·장소·생각의 이름이 되는 말이에요. 독일어 명사는 첫 글자를 대문자로 써요.<span class=\"gt-ex\">예: der Tisch 책상 · die Liebe 사랑</span></span></span>가, <span class=\"gt\" tabindex=\"0\">접속사<span class=\"gt-tip\"><span class=\"gt-t\">접속사</span>단어나 문장을 이어 주는 말이에요. 종류에 따라 어순이 달라져요.<span class=\"gt-ex\">예: und · aber · weil · dass</span></span></span> 뒤에는 문장이 와요 — wegen des Regens · weil es regnete.</div></div><div class=\"trap\"><div class=\"trap-head\"><span class=\"trap-badge\">실수 2</span><span class=\"trap-label\">Fehler</span></div><div style=\"font-weight:600;margin-bottom:10px\">trotz와 obwohl · trotzdem을 섞어요</div><div class=\"trap-ex wrong\"><span style=\"color:var(--no);font-weight:700\">✕</span><span class=\"tx-b\">Trotz er krank war, kam er.<span class=\"tx-n\">trotz + 문장</span></span></div><div class=\"trap-ex right\"><span style=\"color:var(--ok);font-weight:700\">✓</span><span class=\"tx-b\">Trotz seiner Krankheit kam er. · Obwohl er krank war, kam er.<span class=\"tx-n\">아픈데도 왔어요</span></span></div><div class=\"trap-note\">trotz는 전치사, obwohl은 <span class=\"gt\" tabindex=\"0\">종속접속사<span class=\"gt-tip\"><span class=\"gt-t\">종속접속사</span>종속절을 시작하는 접속사예요. 활용된 동사가 종속절 맨 끝으로 가요.<span class=\"gt-ex\">예: weil · dass · wenn · obwohl</span></span></span>, trotzdem은 <span class=\"gt\" tabindex=\"0\">접속부사<span class=\"gt-tip\"><span class=\"gt-t\">접속부사</span>앞 문장과 뜻을 이어 주는 부사예요. 첫 자리에 오면 바로 뒤에 동사가 와요.<span class=\"gt-ex\">예: deshalb · trotzdem · dann</span></span></span>예요(19과).</div></div><div class=\"trap\"><div class=\"trap-head\"><span class=\"trap-badge\">실수 3</span><span class=\"trap-label\">Fehler</span></div><div style=\"font-weight:600;margin-bottom:10px\">부사를 형용사로 바꾸지 않아요</div><div class=\"trap-ex wrong\"><span style=\"color:var(--no);font-weight:700\">✕</span><span class=\"tx-b\">wegen des stark Regens<span class=\"tx-n\">어미 없음</span></span></div><div class=\"trap-ex right\"><span style=\"color:var(--ok);font-weight:700\">✓</span><span class=\"tx-b\">wegen des starken Regens<span class=\"tx-n\">비가 많이 와서</span></span></div><div class=\"trap-note\">명사 앞에 오면 <span class=\"gt\" tabindex=\"0\">형용사<span class=\"gt-tip\"><span class=\"gt-t\">형용사</span>사람이나 사물이 어떤지를 나타내는 말이에요. 명사 앞에서는 어미가 붙어요.<span class=\"gt-ex\">예: Das Buch ist gut. · das gute Buch</span></span></span>예요. 어미를 붙여요(23·24과).</div></div><div class=\"trap\"><div class=\"trap-head\"><span class=\"trap-badge\">실수 4</span><span class=\"trap-label\">Fehler</span></div><div style=\"font-weight:600;margin-bottom:10px\">주어를 1격으로 그대로 둬요</div><div class=\"trap-ex wrong\"><span style=\"color:var(--no);font-weight:700\">✕</span><span class=\"tx-b\">wegen der Anstieg die Preise<span class=\"tx-n\">1격</span></span></div><div class=\"trap-ex right\"><span style=\"color:var(--ok);font-weight:700\">✓</span><span class=\"tx-b\">wegen des Anstiegs der Preise<span class=\"tx-n\">가격이 올라서</span></span></div><div class=\"trap-note\">wegen 뒤의 명사는 <span class=\"gt\" tabindex=\"0\">2격<span class=\"gt-tip\"><span class=\"gt-t\">2격</span>'~⁠의'를 나타내는 자리예요. 다른 명사 뒤에서 누구·무엇의 것인지 나타내요.<span class=\"gt-ex\">예: das Auto des Mannes 그 남자의 차</span></span></span>, 주어였던 말도 그 명사 뒤에서 2격이에요.</div></div><div class=\"sub-head\"><span class=\"sub-badge\">바로 확인</span><span class=\"sub-title\">실수 피하기</span></div><div class=\"quiz-block\"><div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">1.</strong> 바른 문장은?</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">a) Trotz des Schneefalls kamen wir pünktlich an.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) Obwohl des Schneefalls kamen wir pünktlich an.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) Trotz es Schnee gab, kamen wir pünktlich an.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) Trotzdem des Schneefalls kamen wir pünktlich an.</button></div><div class=\"qe\">trotz + 2격 명사.</div></div><div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">2.</strong> 바른 표현은?</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) nach der plötzliche Ende des Spiels</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">b) nach dem plötzlichen Ende des Spiels</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) nachdem dem plötzlichen Ende des Spiels</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) nach dem plötzlich Ende des Spiels</button></div><div class=\"qe\">nach + 3격, 형용사 어미 -en.</div></div><div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">3.</strong> 바른 표현은?</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) bei ankommen der Gäste</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) bei die Ankunft der Gäste</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) bei der Ankunft die Gäste</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">d) bei der Ankunft der Gäste</button></div><div class=\"qe\">주어였던 말은 2격.</div></div><div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">4.</strong> 바른 문장은?</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) Vor ich schlafe, lese ich noch etwas.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">b) Vor dem Schlafen lese ich noch etwas.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) Vor das Schlafen lese ich noch etwas.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) Bevor dem Schlafen lese ich noch etwas.</button></div><div class=\"qe\">vor + 3격 명사, bevor + 문장.</div></div></div></section><section id=\"sec-I\"><div class=\"sh\"><span class=\"sl\">I</span><h2>참고</h2></div><div class=\"callout callout-note\"><span class=\"co-badge co-note\">어디에서 보나요</span><div><p style=\"margin:0 0 8px\">안내문 — <strong>Bei</strong> Feuer Aufzug nicht benutzen. · <strong>Vor</strong> Gebrauch schütteln.<br>뉴스 — <strong>Nach</strong> tagelangen Verhandlungen einigten sich die Parteien.<br>논문 · 보고서 — <strong>Aufgrund</strong> fehlender Daten ist keine Aussage möglich.</p></div></div><div class=\"callout callout-tip\"><span class=\"co-badge co-tip\">쓰기 시험에서</span><div><p style=\"margin:0 0 8px\">글 한 편에 두세 번이면 충분해요. 2격 명사가 줄줄이 이어지면 읽기 어려워요.<br>✕ Wegen der Erhöhung der Preise der Fahrkarten …<br>✓ Weil die Fahrkarten teurer geworden sind, …</p></div></div><div class=\"callout callout-note\"><span class=\"co-badge co-note\">말할 때는 문장으로</span><div><p style=\"margin:0 0 8px\">친구에게는 Weil es geregnet hat, …가 자연스러워요. Aufgrund des Regens …는 방송이나 공지처럼 들려요.</p></div></div></section><section id=\"sec-J\"><div class=\"sh\"><span class=\"sl\">J</span><h2>바로 쓰는 문장 · 일상 회화</h2></div><p>일상에서도 그대로 쓰는 짧은 전치사구예요.</p><div class=\"exl talk-l\"><div class=\"exl-i\"><span class=\"exl-de\"><strong>Bei Gelegenheit</strong> rufe ich dich an.</span><span class=\"exl-ko\">기회 되면 전화할게.</span></div><div class=\"exl-i\"><span class=\"exl-de\"><strong>Aus Versehen</strong> habe ich die Datei gelöscht.</span><span class=\"exl-ko\">실수로 파일을 지웠어.</span></div><div class=\"exl-i\"><span class=\"exl-de\"><strong>Vor lauter Arbeit</strong> komme ich zu nichts.</span><span class=\"exl-ko\">일이 너무 많아서 아무것도 못 해.</span></div><div class=\"exl-i\"><span class=\"exl-de\"><strong>Nach Feierabend</strong> treffe ich Freunde.</span><span class=\"exl-ko\">퇴근하고 친구들을 만나.</span></div><div class=\"exl-i\"><span class=\"exl-de\"><strong>Mit etwas Glück</strong> schaffen wir das.</span><span class=\"exl-ko\">운이 조금 따르면 해낼 수 있어.</span></div><div class=\"exl-i\"><span class=\"exl-de\"><strong>Zum Glück</strong> ist nichts passiert.</span><span class=\"exl-ko\">다행히 아무 일도 없었어.</span></div></div></section><section id=\"summary\"><div class=\"summary-card\"><h2 class=\"sum-title\">이 과 정리</h2><div><div class=\"sum-li\">종속절 ↔ 전치사구 — weil ↔ wegen · aufgrund, obwohl ↔ trotz, wenn ↔ bei · im Falle, um … zu ↔ zu, indem ↔ durch</div><div class=\"sum-li\">시간 — als · wenn ↔ bei, während ↔ während, bevor ↔ vor, nachdem ↔ nach, seitdem ↔ seit, bis ↔ bis zu</div><div class=\"sum-li\">바꾸는 순서 — 접속사 → 전치사, 동사 → 명사, 주어 → 2격(대명사는 소유관사), 부사 → 형용사 + 어미</div><div class=\"sum-li\">이유의 구별 — aus(동기) · vor(저절로 나오는 반응) · dank(좋은 결과), 부정 조건은 ohne</div><div class=\"sum-li\">beim + 원형 명사 — ~⁠할 때 · ~⁠하는 중에</div><div class=\"sum-li\">풀어 읽기 — 전치사 → 접속사, 명사 → 동사, 2격 → 주어, nachdem은 한 단계 앞선 시제</div></div></div></section><section id=\"solutions\" class=\"solutions\"><h2 class=\"sol-title\">Lösungen — 정답 모아보기</h2><div class=\"sol-grid\"><div><b>16·27·35·37과 복습</b>1. Trotz · 2. Ankunft · 3. seiner · 4. Während</div><div><b>접속사와 전치사의 짝</b>1. Trotz · 2. Bei · 3. Seit · 4. Durch</div><div><b>바꾸는 순서</b>1. der Zunahme · 2. seiner · 3. heftigen · 4. Beginn</div><div><b>시간</b>1. ihres Studiums · 2. Beim · 3. dem Ende · 4. zum</div><div><b>이유 · 양보 · 조건</b>1. aus · 2. vor · 3. Ohne · 4. Trotz · 5. Dank</div><div><b>목적 · 방법</b>1. Zur Schonung · 2. Durch · 3. Verbesserung</div><div><b>문장으로 풀기</b>1. Obwohl · 2. angekommen war · 3. Wenn · 4. die Heizung ausgefallen war</div><div><b>실수 피하기</b>1. Trotz des Schneefalls kamen wir pünktlich an. · 2. nach dem plötzlichen Ende des Spiels · 3. bei der Ankunft der Gäste · 4. Vor dem Schlafen lese ich noch etwas.</div></div></section><div class=\"brand-foot\"><img src=\"%%A0%%\" alt=\"Sophia Deutsch Akademie\" class=\"foot-logo\"><div class=\"foot-name\">Sophia Deutsch Akademie</div><div class=\"foot-tag\">Innovative Learning Beyond the Traditional</div></div>"